    },
    {
      "text": "Theorem 2 with Proof",
      "bbox": [
        132.62754821777344,
        650.1007690429688,
        226.06675720214844,
        659.05712890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Theorem 4. Given Assumptions A1-A3 in Main paper, the policy updates in Algorithm 1 will almost",
      "bbox": [
        107.6709976196289,
        670.4827880859375,
        503.9974060058594,
        679.5089111328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "surely converge to a locally optimal policy for our proposed optimization in Equation RESPO.",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        681.5113525390625,
        484.0182800292969,
        690.4179077148438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We first provide an intuitive explanation behind why our REF learns to converge to the safest policy’s",
      "bbox": [
        107.53199768066406,
        702.3363647460938,
        504.0020751953125,
        711.242919921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
